  "code": "const int ledPin = 13;\nconst int potPin = A0;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(ledPin, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int potValue = analogRead(potPin);\n  int blinkDelay = map(potValue, 0, 1023, 50, 1000);\n  digitalWrite(ledPin, HIGH);\n  delay(blinkDelay);\n  digitalWrite(ledPin, LOW);\n  delay(blinkDelay);\n}",
